    "statement": "The trivial and standard S_6-isotypic components of the corner Gr^W_16 H^{16}_c(Z;Q), equivalently of T_16(Z), inject as pure polarizable weight-sixteen Hodge structures into constant-Q-coefficient corners of the balanced tetragonal base and its universal curve: Gr^W_16 H^{16}_c(U) injects into Gr^W_16 H^{16}_c(S) oplus Gr^W_14 H^{14}_c(S)(-1) oplus Gr^W_12 H^{12}_c(S)(-2), and Gr^W_16 H^{16}_c(Z^(1)) injects into Gr^W_16 H^{16}_c(script-C) oplus Gr^W_14 H^{14}_c(script-C)(-1). The coefficient objects of both projective-bundle formulas are constant Tate sheaves, so FND-0164 does not obstruct the identification. Semisimplicity then converts Tate-ness of those constant-coefficient corners into Tate type Q(8) for the corresponding part of T_16(Z). Remaining S_6-isotypics are not controlled.",
